  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Provide safe harbour to people seeking refuge</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Over the past few years, Greece has drastically reduced its support for people seeking refugee, leaving a growing number vulnerable to homelessness, hunger, and cut off from basic services. Our dedicated team steps in daily to fill these gaps. We provide food assistance, help with school and hospital access, and offer mental health support through sports and educational activities with programs that evolve to meet the needs that keep on changing.</narrative>
  </description>
